  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.449,
            0.97,
            0.55,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.562,
            0.047,
            0.847,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Expressions Using Letter-Numbers"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.088,
            0.723,
            0.107
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• the number to the right of ‘a’ will be "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1 more than it",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.113,
            0.648,
            0.131
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "the number below ‘a’ will be "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7 more than it",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.136,
            0.696,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• the number diagonal to ‘a’ will be "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8 more than it",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.161,
            0.695,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So the other numbers in the 2 × 2 square can be represented as shown in the grid. Let us find the diagonal sums; "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a \\pm ( a \\pm 8 )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(a + 1) + (a + 7)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.217,
            0.389,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us simplify them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.706,
            0.148,
            0.843,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.706,
                0.148,
                0.843,
                0.228
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_18_table_7.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>a</td><td>a + 1</td></tr><tr><td>a + 7</td><td>a + 8</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.235,
            0.695,
            0.271
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since the terms can be added in any order, the brackets can be opened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.272,
            0.461,
            0.288
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a + (a + 8) = a + a + 8 = 2a + 8"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.29,
            0.68,
            0.307
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a + 1) + (a + 7) = a + 1 + a + 7 = a + a + 1 + 7 = 2a + 8"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.308,
            0.848,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We see that both diagonal sums are equal to "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 a \\: + \\: 8"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (8 more than 2 times a)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.354,
            0.847,
            0.395
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Verify this expression for diagonal sums by considering any "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " square and taking its top left number to be ‘a’."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.404,
            0.848,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, we have shown that diagonal sums are equal for any value of a, i.e., for any 2 × 2 square!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.455,
            0.232,
            0.497
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.165,
                0.455,
                0.232,
                0.497
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_18_image_14.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.241,
            0.459,
            0.825,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This problem is an example that shows the power of algebraic modelling in verifying whether a pattern will always hold."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.514,
            0.846,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Consider a set of numbers from the calendar (having endless rows) forming under the following shape:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.312,
            0.571,
            0.376,
            0.619
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.312,
                0.571,
                0.376,
                0.619
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_18_image_17.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.396,
            0.558,
            0.602,
            0.679
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.396,
                0.558,
                0.602,
                0.679
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_18_table_18.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td>8</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>15</td><td>16</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>22</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.689,
            0.847,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Find the sum of all the numbers. Compare it with the number in the centre: 15. Repeat this for another set of numbers that forms this shape. What do you observe?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.757,
            0.832,
            0.777
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We see that the total sum is always 5 times the number in the centre."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.785,
            0.637,
            0.808
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Will this always happen? How do you show this?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.818,
            0.772,
            0.905,
            0.825
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 22,
              "bbox": [
                0.818,
                0.772,
                0.905,
                0.825
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_18_image_22.jpg",
